      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p>
    Neither pattern should be read as "content writing freelancing is a dead end" or "copywriting is only for
    agency employees." Both statements are true at once: content writing has more total freelance gigs at a
    compressed price, and copywriting has fewer freelance gigs at a meaningfully higher price once you can
    prove results. Pick based on whether you would rather have more, smaller opportunities or fewer, bigger
    ones — and how much proof-of-work you can build before you need the income.
  </p>

  <h2 id="skill-overlap">Skill overlap and where the two fields split</h2>

  <p>
    The two careers share more foundation than people assume, then diverge sharply on a few specific skills.
  </p>

  <div class="feature-grid">
